<section class="music-studio content-view" data-studio aria-label="节奏实验室">
 <header class="studio-mast studio-illustrated"><img class="studio-soundcheck" src="<%= url_for(theme.nijika.studio_art) %>" alt="金、朱红与墨色套印的虹夏演出海报" width="1672" height="941"><div><span class="eyebrow">CC ATELIER / NIJIKA'S RHYTHM ROOM</span><h1 tabindex="-1">下一拍<span>由你。</span></h1></div><a href="<%= url_for('atelier/') %>">返回后台 ↗</a><div class="studio-mast-mark" aria-hidden="true">RHYTHM<br>LAB<span>06 TRACKS / ONE LITTLE DREAM</span></div></header>
 <noscript><p>节奏实验室需要 JavaScript。你仍可前往<a href="<%= url_for('notes/') %>">笔记档案</a>阅读。</p></noscript>
 <div class="studio-console" hidden>
  <div class="studio-top"><label class="studio-project-name">TAPE / <input data-project-name maxlength="60" aria-label="项目名称" value="放学后的排练"></label><span class="studio-live-indicator"><i></i><b data-studio-mode>STANDBY</b></span><button class="lighting-open">调光台 ↗</button></div>
  <div class="studio-monitor"><div class="studio-monitor-title"><span>MASTER / OUTPUT</span><strong data-step-display>—<small>/16</small></strong><span data-studio-time>等待你的第一拍</span></div><canvas data-audio-scope aria-label="实时音频波形与频谱"></canvas><div class="studio-monitor-level"><span>LEVEL</span><div><i data-master-level></i></div><span>−∞ → 0</span></div></div>
  <div class="studio-transport"><button data-studio-play class="studio-play" aria-pressed="false">▶ 播放</button><button data-studio-stop aria-label="停止播放">■</button><label class="studio-tempo">BPM<input data-bpm type="number" min="60" max="180" value="112"></label><button data-studio-tap>TAP</button><label>摆动 <input data-swing type="range" min="0" max="60" value="0"><output data-swing-output>0%</output></label><label>总音量<input data-master type="range" min="0" max="100" value="65"></label><label>步数<select data-step-count><option value="16">16 STEPS</option><option value="32">32 STEPS</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="studio-pattern-bar"><span>SEQUENCER / 点击切换音符力度</span><div><button data-studio-undo aria-label="撤销">↶</button><button data-studio-redo aria-label="重做">↷</button><label>预设 <select data-studio-preset><option value="indie">放学后的排练</option><option value="halftime">慢半拍</option><option value="blank">空白录音带</option></select></label></div></div>
  <div class="studio-sequencer-scroll"><div data-sequencer class="studio-sequencer"></div></div>
  <div class="studio-key"><span><i></i>强拍</span><span><i class="soft"></i>轻拍</span><span>空格 播放 / 停止</span><span>A S D F G H 即兴敲击</span><span>方向键移动音符焦点</span></div>
  <div class="studio-bottom"><div><span class="eyebrow">TAKE IT WITH YOU</span><h2>把这一段，<br>录进自己的磁带。</h2><p data-studio-status role="status">声音由浏览器实时合成，不会自动播放。</p></div><div class="studio-export"><div><button data-studio-save>保存项目</button><button data-studio-load>载入项目</button><button data-project-export>导出 JSON</button><label class="studio-import">导入 JSON<input data-project-import type="file" accept=".json,application/json"></label></div><div><label>录制长度<select data-export-loops><option value="1">1 轮</option><option value="2" selected>2 轮</option><option value="4">4 轮</option></select></label><button data-wav-export class="studio-wav">⇩ 导出立体声 WAV</button></div></div></div>
 </div>
 <p class="studio-footnote">离开页面或切换到后台时，演奏会停止。戴上耳机，从小音量开始。</p>
</section>
